* Free T4 (Thyroxine): 0.8 - 2.8 ng/dL — Circulating storage form of thyroid hormone waiting to be converted into cellular fuel.
* Free T3 (Triiodothyronine): 2.3 - 4.2 pg/mL — Active, converted thyroid hormone driving thermal energy and cognitive alertness.

